# Smallest-possible handshake. Verifies the active-open three-way handshake
# completes and the SYN carries our required options.

--connect 10.0.0.1:49152 10.0.0.2:80

+0 > SEW 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460, wscale 5, sackOK, TS val * ecr 0>
+.005 < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 32768 <mss 1460, wscale 7, sackOK, TS val 1000 ecr *>
+0 > . 1:1(0) ack 1 <TS val * ecr 1000>

--expect_state ESTABLISHED
